00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:18.384
They told us that there has been no order

00:05:18.618 --> 00:05:20.553
to pull back from back mount,

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.321
that there are fighting

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:23.122
